heir own unique futures.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wild Radio Flux invites you to travel back, at least for fun, to a hypothetical &quot;1985,&quot;. It will be your mission to collect as many musical and cultural items as possible to stop the dystopian technological drift, before tech giants and big data corporations have infiltrated our lives, relentlessly driving us to transfer our existence onto their servers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore </strong>diverse stages, <strong>unlock </strong>new levels, and advance through the game as you <strong>collect legendary items</strong> and <strong>power up your hero</strong>. Discover and unleash a range of unique weapons while immersing yourself in the nostalgic dream of 16-bit gaming, where music and adventure collide in an endless, unforgettable experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Press JUMP twice for a double jump</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888480/extras/30e12a2e1ae7598f78888826d752c95f.poster.avif?t=1749501070\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888480/extras/30e12a2e1ae7598f78888826d752c95f.webm?t=1749501070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888480/extras/30e12a2e1ae7598f78888826d752c95f.mp4?t=1749501070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Press RIGHT or LEFT twice to overpass dangerous obstacles</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888480/extras/5ec6857d1d342cb16fc5ba299bbbd9b8